]that day I recieved a message saying that the save file could not be
]found.  This ruined a great character.  I know I could have backed up my

Look at the /usr/games/lib/nethackdir/save directory.  You'll see
files there with names like "1059wcs" or "325superman" -
(without reading the source, it seems to be) <UID><CharacterName>.
To recover your save file, you'll need to tell nethack the name to
look for; try setting "name" in your NETHACKOPTIONS variable.
I had a game where I was "wcs", got polymorphed a few times and
ended up changing my name to "wcs_the_human" ; the save file name
was truncated to something like 1059wcs_t, so I set name:wcs_t and
it recovered ok.

